WEBVTT

00:03.720 --> 00:05.260
<b>What was that about?</b>

00:06.590 --> 00:08.600
<b>I was just thinking about yesterday.</b>

00:09.840 --> 00:13.060
<b>You prioritized what's important 
to Shea over the labyrinth.</b>

00:13.700 --> 00:16.530
<b>I'm so happy that Shea 
is important to you now.</b>

00:16.530 --> 00:19.360
<b>I'm so happy that more things 
are important to you now.</b>

00:19.800 --> 00:21.160
<b>I'm so, so happy...</b>

00:23.760 --> 00:25.880
<b>Is Shea "special" too now?</b>

00:26.300 --> 00:31.790
<b>Well, she's important to me, 
second to none, almost.</b>

00:32.150 --> 00:34.760
<b>But Yue, you're the only 
one that's "special."</b>

00:34.950 --> 00:37.410
<b>Hmm. I would allow it, if it were Shea.</b>

00:37.710 --> 00:39.650
<b>But that does make me happy. I'm torn.</b>

00:39.980 --> 00:40.870
<b>Are you dissatisfied?</b>

00:41.620 --> 00:42.780
<b>Mmm, Haji—</b>

00:45.370 --> 00:47.960
<b>Hey, Nagumo, are you here?</b>

00:49.110 --> 00:51.770
<b>Damn it. That guy has the worst timing.</b>

00:52.450 --> 00:54.850
<b>This is getting awkward.</b>

00:54.850 --> 00:57.030
<b>Hajime, no escape.</b>

00:57.760 --> 00:58.720
<b>Wait—</b>

01:00.630 --> 01:02.240
<b>Kouki, did you find Nagumo-kun?</b>

01:02.620 --> 01:06.030
<b>Yeah, I can sense his presence over here—</b>

01:08.180 --> 01:12.290
<b>Whoa! What are you doing 
first thing in the morning?!</b>

01:12.560 --> 01:14.300
<b>Oh, you want to join, Shea?</b>

01:14.300 --> 01:17.130
<b>Huh? You sure? Don't mind if I—</b>

01:17.130 --> 01:19.600
<b>No way! Stand back!</b>

01:19.860 --> 01:24.600
<b>Getting naughty in the morning, 
I'm jealous—I mean, that's absurd!</b>

01:24.810 --> 01:27.620
<b>May I join too?</b>

03:00.030 --> 03:05.080
<b>Episode 03: The Princess's Ordeal</b>

03:15.160 --> 03:17.720
<b>Welcome, Princess Liliana.</b>

03:18.680 --> 03:24.800
<b>This is quite a sudden visit. 
I hope you have great news worthy of it.</b>

03:27.240 --> 03:30.010
<b>I'm afraid I must disappoint you...</b>

03:33.650 --> 03:38.520
<b>I see... King Eliheid, Loggins, and...</b>

03:39.340 --> 03:44.030
<b>That old pope who seemed 
almost immortal... All dead...</b>

03:45.230 --> 03:48.530
<b>It must have been a terrible disaster.</b>

03:49.020 --> 03:53.550
<b>This man, Hajime Nagumo, 
is he really that powerful?</b>

03:53.680 --> 03:56.240
<b>His baseline attitude 
is mutual noninterference.</b>

03:56.560 --> 03:59.300
<b>I think it's best if you 
stayed away from him.</b>

04:00.970 --> 04:04.550
<b>Well, you didn't come here just 
to deliver information, did you?</b>

04:04.760 --> 04:07.930
<b>Correct. To be blunt, 
I am here to ask for aid,</b>

04:08.280 --> 04:11.790
<b>and to discuss how we can 
collaborate moving forward.</b>

04:12.650 --> 04:13.880
<b>I see.</b>

04:15.040 --> 04:17.360
<b>I can send a division of soldiers.</b>

04:17.850 --> 04:20.190
<b>The Kingdom being defeated 
would be bad for us too,</b>

04:20.190 --> 04:24.000
<b>as we would be forced to split 
our forces to the west as well.</b>

04:24.360 --> 04:25.850
<b>Thank you.</b>

04:26.320 --> 04:28.600
<b>What's most important is 
how we present our newly</b>

04:28.600 --> 04:31.000
<b>strengthened relationship 
to the outside world.</b>

04:32.080 --> 04:37.490
<b>Princess Liliana, you'll be 
playing a key role in that.</b>

04:37.490 --> 04:38.880
<b>I understand.</b>

04:40.200 --> 04:43.380
<b>Don't look so tense. 
It's just an engagement.</b>

04:43.800 --> 04:47.820
<b>Baius is who he is, but well, 
you're a princess too.</b>

04:47.820 --> 04:49.350
<b>See if you can tame him.</b>

04:51.160 --> 04:52.440
<b>By the way, Princess.</b>

04:53.140 --> 04:58.730
<b>Last night, four fools wearing 
stupid masks attacked us.</b>

04:59.110 --> 05:00.480
<b>What do you think?</b>

05:00.690 --> 05:02.770
<b>Is it the Demons?</b>

05:03.370 --> 05:08.390
<b>I don't think they'd put on stupid masks,</b>

05:08.640 --> 05:10.990
<b>but I guess it's not completely impossible.</b>

05:11.890 --> 05:18.000
<b>Even if one of them used 
a sword similar to the holy sword.</b>

05:18.130 --> 05:20.980
<b>That's... Terrifying.</b>

05:21.380 --> 05:26.010
<b>What are they doing?! 
Why even wear a mask at that point?!</b>

05:26.800 --> 05:28.630
<b>Yeah, indeed.</b>

05:28.630 --> 05:32.360
<b>They kept yapping about improving the working 
conditions of beastmen slaves or something.</b>

05:32.680 --> 05:36.010
<b>It's such nonsense.
I was completely baffled, scared even.</b>

05:36.680 --> 05:41.280
<b>It's as if they came from another world.</b>

05:41.670 --> 05:43.490
<b>An encounter with the unknown.</b>

05:43.490 --> 05:45.080
<b>Yes, indeed.</b>

05:45.670 --> 05:46.980
<b>Princess Liliana.</b>

05:46.980 --> 05:47.880
<b>Yes?</b>

05:47.880 --> 05:53.310
<b>The famous Hero went to the forest 
with Hajime Nagumo, correct?</b>

05:53.310 --> 05:54.640
<b>Yes, that's correct.</b>

05:54.640 --> 05:56.430
<b>I see, I see.</b>

05:57.050 --> 06:01.290
<b>By the way, I captured some 
interesting beastmen recently.</b>

06:02.790 --> 06:07.420
<b>A very... Very peculiar 
group of rabbit beastmen.</b>

06:09.320 --> 06:14.140
<b>They went toe to toe with our soldiers, 
despite being outside the forest.</b>

06:14.530 --> 06:16.340
<b>They had nerves of steel 
and killer instincts,</b>

06:16.340 --> 06:18.390
<b>unlike any other rabbit 
beastmen we've ever seen.</b>

06:18.710 --> 06:22.690
<b>Wow, and here I thought rabbit beastmen 
were the embodiment of peace.</b>

06:22.690 --> 06:26.560
<b>I suppose some terrifying tribes do exist.</b>

06:27.780 --> 06:32.410
<b>Those rabbit beastmen all broke 
out of our dungeon last night.</b>

06:33.100 --> 06:35.820
<b>At the same time as the stupid masks.</b>

06:36.280 --> 06:39.330
<b>He's here! He's so definitely here!</b>

06:39.330 --> 06:43.920
<b>Nobody else can break a whole 
tribe out of prison unnoticed!</b>

06:44.300 --> 06:46.390
<b>By the way, Princess Liliana...</b>

06:46.390 --> 06:48.420
<b>Yes, Emperor, what is it?</b>

06:48.920 --> 06:52.870
<b>Hajime Nagumo has absurdly 
strong companions, right?</b>

06:53.170 --> 06:56.440
<b>And one of them is a rabbit beastman?</b>

06:56.440 --> 07:01.440
<b>Yes, I believe that's correct.
What about it?</b>

07:01.760 --> 07:05.440
<b>He obviously knew I'd get 
put in hot water for this.</b>

07:05.440 --> 07:07.440
<b>How awful!</b>

07:09.250 --> 07:10.410
<b>What is it?</b>

07:11.300 --> 07:14.240
<b>There are guests who are here 
to see Princess Liliana...</b>

07:14.750 --> 07:16.740
<b>Me?</b>

07:17.040 --> 07:18.500
<b>It is the Hero, and his companions.</b>

07:19.000 --> 07:22.080
<b>Why come in from the front door?!</b>

07:25.940 --> 07:29.300
<b>I heard that the Hero 
and his companions are here.</b>

07:29.300 --> 07:30.330
<b>Is that you?</b>

07:31.040 --> 07:34.060
<b>Um, yes, that's us.</b>

07:34.380 --> 07:38.470
<b>I am Grid Half, Captain of the Third Squad.</b>

07:38.970 --> 07:40.560
<b>Pleasure to make your acquaintance.</b>

07:41.400 --> 07:46.040
<b>Princess Liliana is aware of your arrival.</b>

07:46.320 --> 07:47.460
<b>I see.</b>

07:48.060 --> 07:50.810
<b>By the way, sir, who is 
that rabbit beastman?</b>

07:52.220 --> 07:54.390
<b>That's not a slave's 
necklace she's wearing, is it?</b>

07:54.590 --> 07:57.080
<b>Huh? No, she's—</b>

07:57.080 --> 08:01.080
<b>Hey, bunny girl. Quick question for ya.</b>

08:01.390 --> 08:03.960
<b>We've met before, haven't we?</b>

08:03.960 --> 08:06.050
<b>Huh? What are you talking about...</b>

08:13.060 --> 08:14.590
<b>No...</b>

08:15.070 --> 08:18.920
<b>Your friends sold really well 
to the slave merchants.</b>

08:19.690 --> 08:23.500
<b>You, girl, might make us even richer.</b>

08:25.120 --> 08:26.850
<b>What's that look?</b>

08:27.220 --> 08:31.600
<b>You think being with 
the hero makes you safe?</b>

08:31.760 --> 08:35.370
<b>Know your place, pathetic beastman!</b>

08:39.290 --> 08:42.270
<b>I'm sorry, Sir Hero.</b>

08:42.270 --> 08:45.120
<b>Could you hand over this rabbit beastman?</b>

08:45.510 --> 08:47.580
<b>If you want a female rabbit beastman,</b>

08:47.580 --> 08:50.550
<b>I can find you another. 
It would be great if you could...</b>

08:51.160 --> 08:52.430
<b>That's...</b>

08:52.430 --> 08:53.760
<b>Hey, low-life.</b>

08:55.680 --> 08:56.520
<b>Excuse me?</b>

08:57.360 --> 08:59.250
<b>Get on with it.</b>

08:59.250 --> 08:59.840
<b>You—</b>

08:59.840 --> 09:03.960
<b>We have exactly zero time to spare for you.</b>

09:05.170 --> 09:06.680
<b>Know your place.</b>

09:13.800 --> 09:15.080
<b>So?</b>

09:15.080 --> 09:20.400
<b>What in the world are you all doing here?</b>

09:20.400 --> 09:23.040
<b>And what was that charade last night? 
I need an explanation.</b>

09:23.280 --> 09:25.500
<b>I won't let you change the subject!</b>

09:25.500 --> 09:29.990
<b>Especially you, Nagumo-san! 
I know you're pulling the strings!</b>

09:29.990 --> 09:34.720
<b>There's no need to shout.
I'm right here. I can hear you.</b>

09:35.370 --> 09:38.060
<b>But you're not listening!</b>

09:38.530 --> 09:40.480
<b>C-Calm down, Lily!</b>

09:40.480 --> 09:44.870
<b>Cut me some slack, 
Princess. It's complicated.</b>

09:45.480 --> 09:48.470
<b>Shea is a little unstable right now.</b>

09:49.420 --> 09:53.240
<b>Unstable? Is something wrong?</b>

09:53.450 --> 09:55.100
<b>I'm fine!</b>

10:00.280 --> 10:04.940
<b>Why are you here? What about 
the labyrinth in the forest?</b>

10:05.460 --> 10:09.510
<b>Emperor Gahard will grant us audience soon.</b>

10:09.890 --> 10:15.010
<b>I need you to give me at least the bare 
minimum information to line up our stories.</b>

10:15.010 --> 10:19.090
<b>Don't get so worked up. 
You'll find out at nighttime.</b>

10:19.090 --> 10:22.120
<b>You can just tell him, 
we finished our business early,</b>

10:22.120 --> 10:25.640
<b>so we stopped by before we took 
off to our next destination.</b>

10:25.790 --> 10:30.400
<b>That simple? At nighttime?</b>

10:30.400 --> 10:33.400
<b>What, are you going to go 
on a masked rampage again?!</b>

10:33.730 --> 10:39.150
<b>I already know it's you, Nagumo-san, who 
made Shizuku and the others dress foolishly!</b>

10:39.300 --> 10:42.660
<b>Don't get so cranky. You'll go bald.</b>

10:43.050 --> 10:47.040
<b>I won't go bald! Who says that to a lady?!</b>

10:47.680 --> 10:48.480
<b>Princess Baldy.</b>

10:48.480 --> 10:49.670
<b>Yue-san?!</b>

10:50.460 --> 10:54.290
<b>Last night, in addition 
to the masked assailant incident,</b>

10:54.290 --> 10:56.240
<b>there was also a prison break.</b>

10:56.240 --> 10:57.970
<b>Assuming that was Nagumo-san's doing.</b>

10:57.970 --> 11:02.550
<b>No benefit of the doubt? How awful.</b>

11:02.720 --> 11:07.120
<b>You can't be serious. 
Not that you told me anything.</b>

11:07.120 --> 11:10.560
<b>The captured rabbit beastmen 
were the Haulia tribe, correct?</b>

11:11.120 --> 11:14.070
<b>I understand that you 
rescued them for Shea-san.</b>

11:14.280 --> 11:18.070
<b>What I don't understand is, 
why come barging in now?</b>

11:18.290 --> 11:20.290
<b>What are you thinking?</b>

11:20.920 --> 11:23.570
<b>I have no idea what you're talking about.</b>

11:24.240 --> 11:28.400
<b>W-What?! What... Why not?!</b>

11:31.580 --> 11:33.750
<b>The emperor will see you now.</b>

11:41.400 --> 11:43.440
<b>Are you Hajime Nagumo?</b>

11:46.640 --> 11:50.270
<b>Yes, I am Hajime Nagumo.</b>

11:50.690 --> 11:53.480
<b>It is a great honor 
to meet you, Your Highness.</b>

11:51.080 --> 11:51.600
<b>What?!</b>

11:51.610 --> 11:52.550
<b>You've got to be kidding me!</b>

11:53.480 --> 11:54.930
<b>This is scary!</b>

11:55.160 --> 11:58.160
<b>I'm royalty too. Why the difference...</b>

11:58.530 --> 12:00.950
<b>Why are you guys reacting like that?</b>

12:03.720 --> 12:05.860
<b>Just be your usual self.</b>

12:06.120 --> 12:10.620
<b>Princess Liliana already told me 
how insolent you usually are.</b>

12:11.000 --> 12:15.130
<b>I want to see the truth. 
Just show your true colors already.</b>

12:15.270 --> 12:15.890
<b>Damn it.</b>

12:18.980 --> 12:22.480
<b>Yeah, fine, then. Normal it is.</b>

12:23.800 --> 12:25.950
<b>I have a great deal of interest in you.</b>

12:26.200 --> 12:32.320
<b>I heard you conquered a Great Labyrinth and 
gained the ability to create artifacts there.</b>

12:32.920 --> 12:35.510
<b>Artifacts that can 
obliterate Demonic armies</b>

12:35.510 --> 12:39.640
<b>and cover months of travel 
distance in mere days.</b>

12:39.640 --> 12:42.620
<b>Is this true?</b>

12:42.880 --> 12:43.600
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:44.410 --> 12:49.330
<b>And that you have no intention of sharing 
these artifacts with the Kingdom or the Empire?</b>

12:49.330 --> 12:50.080
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:50.750 --> 12:56.880
<b>What right do you have to monopolize 
such awesome powers as just an individual?</b>

12:57.090 --> 12:59.120
<b>Who's going to stop me?</b>

12:59.120 --> 13:01.840
<b>If I didn't have the right, 
what would you do about it?</b>

13:12.550 --> 13:14.600
<b>Emperor Gahard!</b>

13:16.400 --> 13:19.740
<b>All right! Stand down! 
He totally sees through everything.</b>

13:20.130 --> 13:23.070
<b>This one is truly a terrifying monster.</b>

13:23.400 --> 13:26.860
<b>If we fought now, we'd all 
get massacred on the spot.</b>

13:27.630 --> 13:30.080
<b>Why are you enjoying this?</b>

13:30.080 --> 13:33.080
<b>Hey, I'm the head of the Empire.</b>

13:33.420 --> 13:37.320
<b>Who would I be, if seeing 
a strong guy doesn't excite me?</b>

13:38.520 --> 13:39.960
<b>On top of that.</b>

13:40.520 --> 13:44.010
<b>Those girls you have around you, 
they're off the charts as well.</b>

13:44.400 --> 13:45.740
<b>Where did you find them?</b>

13:45.740 --> 13:48.420
<b>Can you share at least 
one of them, Hajime Nagumo?</b>

13:48.620 --> 13:51.030
<b>Cut it out before I crack your skull.</b>

13:52.270 --> 13:53.390
<b>Or, wait.</b>

13:53.870 --> 13:55.250
<b>I can spare Tio.</b>

13:55.250 --> 14:00.400
<b>W-What?! How cold! Oh, that's wonderful!</b>

14:00.640 --> 14:03.370
<b>She has issues,
 but at least she has good looks.</b>

14:03.370 --> 14:04.360
<b>I'm drooling.</b>

14:04.580 --> 14:07.400
<b>Sorry, even the emperor has limits.</b>

14:09.280 --> 14:13.660
<b>Personally, that rabbit 
beastman piques my interest.</b>

14:14.040 --> 14:18.000
<b>I've never seen one with such a hair color,</b>

14:18.000 --> 14:20.920
<b>and she doesn't seem to be 
bothered by my threatening aura.</b>

14:21.390 --> 14:25.960
<b>That attitude reminds me 
of some toys I captured recently.</b>

14:25.960 --> 14:27.640
<b>What do you think?</b>

14:34.300 --> 14:36.520
<b>Toys? I don't know.</b>

14:36.900 --> 14:40.970
<b>Doesn't ring a bell? 
Do you want to take a look?</b>

14:41.810 --> 14:47.030
<b>I actually still have a few. 
Women and children. They're quite...</b>

14:47.340 --> 14:49.030
<b>Not interested.</b>

14:50.280 --> 14:55.160
<b>Ah. Well, they had incredibly well-forged 
short swords and other equipment.</b>

14:55.780 --> 14:59.550
<b>Still not interested, Master Transmuter?</b>

14:59.900 --> 15:02.500
<b>I don't use swords.</b>

15:02.880 --> 15:06.760
<b>By the way, some prisoners broke 
out of our dungeon last night.</b>

15:06.940 --> 15:10.040
<b>Easily breaking in and out of a castle.</b>

15:10.040 --> 15:12.370
<b>You wouldn't know of any 
special magic or artifacts</b>

15:12.370 --> 15:14.600
<b>that could allow such an act, would you?</b>

15:15.080 --> 15:18.180
<b>No idea. That sounds cool.</b>

15:19.760 --> 15:22.220
<b>One last question.</b>

15:23.190 --> 15:25.880
<b>What would it take 
for you to ally with the Empire?</b>

15:27.400 --> 15:29.850
<b>A way back to my original world.</b>

15:30.480 --> 15:33.040
<b>I'll cheer for the Empire once I get home.</b>

15:33.360 --> 15:37.110
<b>Damn it, the stories about you were true.</b>

15:37.360 --> 15:40.320
<b>What an insufferable brat you are.</b>

15:45.290 --> 15:48.400
<b>Well, I got the bare minimum confirmation.</b>

15:48.400 --> 15:51.370
<b>This will have to do for now.</b>

15:51.840 --> 15:54.380
<b>The Empire is busy right now, too.</b>

15:54.910 --> 15:58.000
<b>We'll be holding a welcoming banquet 
for Princess Liliana tonight.</b>

15:58.000 --> 16:00.390
<b>I'd like you all to attend.</b>

16:01.120 --> 16:05.020
<b>It doubles as the engagement party 
between my son and the Princess.</b>

16:06.640 --> 16:09.280
<b>Lily! Engagement?! 
What is he talking about?!</b>

16:09.840 --> 16:14.160
<b>Our king has passed away. 
Our kingdom is on shaky ground.</b>

16:14.160 --> 16:17.560
<b>Strengthening our bond 
with our ally is top priority.</b>

16:18.290 --> 16:19.680
<b>But...</b>

16:20.280 --> 16:23.320
<b>Did you know this was going to happen?</b>

16:24.380 --> 16:27.380
<b>It was always tacitly understood 
that we were engaged,</b>

16:27.380 --> 16:29.710
<b>but this banquet will make it official.</b>

16:30.040 --> 16:35.050
<b>No better time than now, when we 
are all shaken by the Demonic invasion.</b>

16:35.340 --> 16:38.310
<b>What about the rest of the Kingdom? 
Don't you need to discuss it with them?</b>

16:38.800 --> 16:40.790
<b>They will have to accept 
my decision after the fact,</b>

16:40.790 --> 16:42.310
<b>but I doubt they would oppose.</b>

16:42.800 --> 16:46.010
<b>Lily, do you even like that person?</b>

16:46.410 --> 16:52.600
<b>That's not important right now. 
This is for uniting the two nations together.</b>

16:52.910 --> 16:56.560
<b>W-Why are you so calm?!</b>

16:56.890 --> 16:59.320
<b>I am royalty. It's only natural.</b>

16:59.320 --> 17:00.660
<b>What do you mean, natural?</b>

17:01.070 --> 17:06.080
<b>You're a girl too. Don't you 
want to marry a person you love?</b>

17:08.540 --> 17:11.620
<b>Hey, Nagumo! Don't you have 
anything to say about this?!</b>

17:12.090 --> 17:13.590
<b>What am I supposed to say?</b>

17:14.520 --> 17:18.090
<b>This is just politics 
taking on the form of marriage.</b>

17:18.680 --> 17:21.200
<b>It's no place for us amateurs to object.</b>

17:22.360 --> 17:23.600
<b>B-But...</b>

17:24.050 --> 17:27.860
<b>We have work to do. Don't get distracted.</b>

17:28.960 --> 17:32.860
<b>Damn it! He's always so cold.</b>

17:33.700 --> 17:34.880
<b>Calm down.</b>

17:35.330 --> 17:39.360
<b>Besides, this might not be 
that big of an issue.</b>

17:39.730 --> 17:40.360
<b>Huh?</b>

17:41.640 --> 17:43.200
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

17:43.200 --> 17:45.280
<b>They might get caught up 
with something else.</b>

17:45.280 --> 17:50.630
<b>This is a welcoming party, right? 
I'm getting a stomachache.</b>

17:50.630 --> 17:55.650
<b>I guess it's a party of sorts. 
Not very welcoming, though.</b>

17:57.040 --> 17:58.480
<b>Huh?</b>

17:58.480 --> 18:01.390
<b>Um, everyone? Why are you like this?</b>

18:01.740 --> 18:05.330
<b>This is extremely worrying.</b>

18:06.870 --> 18:09.900
<b>Oh, how beautiful, Princess Liliana!</b>

18:10.120 --> 18:12.920
<b>Yes, like a fairy!</b>

18:13.160 --> 18:15.900
<b>I'm sure the prince would be delighted!</b>

18:16.920 --> 18:18.000
<b>Thank you.</b>

18:21.910 --> 18:24.950
<b>Lundel, please look after the Kingdom...</b>

18:30.200 --> 18:31.480
<b>Prince Baius.</b>

18:31.480 --> 18:34.680
<b>So that's the dress for tonight? Not bad.</b>

18:34.840 --> 18:39.090
<b>Barging into a lady's room like 
that is not pleasant.</b>

18:39.090 --> 18:39.900
<b>Huh?</b>

18:40.730 --> 18:44.960
<b>I'm about to become your husband. 
What right do you have to complain?</b>

18:49.390 --> 18:51.920
<b>All of you, get out.</b>

18:58.480 --> 18:59.610
<b>You are dismissed.</b>

19:08.720 --> 19:11.260
<b>Train your dogs better.</b>

19:11.620 --> 19:15.120
<b>They are no dogs. 
They are my precious retainers.</b>

19:16.210 --> 19:18.640
<b>Always so rebellious!</b>

19:19.240 --> 19:20.090
<b>No!</b>

19:21.080 --> 19:22.880
<b>I guess you grew a little.</b>

19:23.380 --> 19:26.230
<b>Definitely not enough, 
but it should be pretty tasty.</b>

19:26.480 --> 19:27.860
<b>N-No!</b>

19:30.600 --> 19:33.240
<b>Go ahead and scream.</b>

19:33.240 --> 19:39.200
<b>Even if your dogs came in? They can't 
do anything to me, the crown prince.</b>

19:39.520 --> 19:43.480
<b>Actually, do you want them 
to watch you lose your virginity?</b>

19:44.900 --> 19:46.950
<b>Why... Why would you...</b>

19:46.950 --> 19:50.460
<b>Those eyes. Those rebellious eyes.</b>

19:50.460 --> 19:55.680
<b>I want to fill them with pain, 
despair, and pleasure.</b>

19:56.820 --> 20:03.800
<b>I love nothing more than 
making those who resist me obey.</b>

20:04.340 --> 20:08.400
<b>Once I got a taste of that, 
I couldn't resist.</b>

20:08.880 --> 20:10.770
<b>You're such a...</b>

20:11.850 --> 20:13.620
<b>Hey, Liliana.</b>

20:14.030 --> 20:16.540
<b>You're going to lose your 
chastity before marriage</b>

20:16.540 --> 20:18.860
<b>in fact, before your engagement ceremony.</b>

20:18.860 --> 20:21.650
<b>How are you going to manage 
attending the party after that?</b>

20:37.750 --> 20:38.400
<b>Ow!</b>

20:39.160 --> 20:41.590
<b>What was that, on my neck...</b>

20:51.240 --> 20:55.890
<b>What the... world... spinning...</b>

21:03.500 --> 21:05.500
<b>A metal... spider?</b>

21:07.860 --> 21:09.280
<b>Is it...</b>

21:14.770 --> 21:17.120
<b>Thank you, Nagumo-san.</b>

21:22.290 --> 21:24.140
<b>How's the preparation going, Hajime?</b>

21:24.140 --> 21:25.680
<b>Really well.</b>

21:25.950 --> 21:28.450
<b>Are there lots of traps?</b>

21:28.720 --> 21:30.010
<b>Not a problem.</b>

21:30.010 --> 21:33.210
<b>I'm glad tonight is the party.</b>

21:33.220 --> 21:37.080
<b>The more people, the easier it 
is to move, correct?</b>

21:37.400 --> 21:39.260
<b>Will this work?</b>

21:50.130 --> 21:51.860
<b>Everyone...</b>

21:58.060 --> 21:59.040
<b>Now.</b>

21:59.780 --> 22:01.800
<b>Let's get this party started.</b>

23:33.050 --> 23:40.060
<b>Episode 04: The Empire versus 
the Terrifying Rabbits</b>

23:35.050 --> 23:38.500
<b>Next episode: The Empire versus 
the Terrifying Rabbits</b>
